{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20227","headline":"峡哀 三 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三峡一线天，三峡万绳泉。\n上仄碎日月，下掣狂漪涟。\n破魂一两点，凝幽数百年。\n峡晖不停午，峡险多饥涎。\n树根锁枯棺，孤骨褭褭悬。\n树枝哭霜栖，哀韵杳杳鲜。\n逐客零落肠，到此汤火煎。\n性命如纺绩，道路随索缘。\n奠泪吊波灵，波灵将闪然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}